[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Smith/How Are You Doing.mp3" volume="-15.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Smith: Suth? Can you hear me? How are you doing?\
\
Well, look Suth, we've got some increased traffic expected this week. I know you... you've got a lot going on. But do you think you could turn your light on? I know you've got some mechanical issues since the attack... Radio me if you can. Or if you just want to talk. I'm here for you.
